{"4549500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sleepover", "steam_appid": 4549500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the not-so-distant future, two girls experience the last Sleepover on Earth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven cosmic horror adventure about the last two humans alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>'There is no point in living past tonight, so let's make some good memories before we leave together.'</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/667ab39fe87041c8818e74a50ebe3693.poster.avif?t=1786438697\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/667ab39fe87041c8818e74a50ebe3693.webm?t=1786438697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/667ab39fe87041c8818e74a50ebe3693.mp4?t=1786438697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Involved Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and interact with the objects in your apartment. But don't go inside <i><strong>that</strong></i> room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/18dfc3332dcf1b42e604513018c7ed00.poster.avif?t=1786438697\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/18dfc3332dcf1b42e604513018c7ed00.webm?t=1786438697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/18dfc3332dcf1b42e604513018c7ed00.mp4?t=1786438697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real when shared</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the last night for both of you, possibly the last sentient life in the universe. You should at least try to make it a happy one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/5f322daf8eb35a48b151bf0ce5e6033f.poster.avif?t=1786438697\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/5f322daf8eb35a48b151bf0ce5e6033f.webm?t=1786438697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/5f322daf8eb35a48b151bf0ce5e6033f.mp4?t=1786438697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the not-so-distant future, two girls experience the last Sleepover on Earth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven cosmic horror adventure about the last two humans alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>'There is no point in living past tonight, so let's make some good memories before we leave together.'</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/667ab39fe87041c8818e74a50ebe3693.poster.avif?t=1786438697\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/667ab39fe87041c8818e74a50ebe3693.webm?t=1786438697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/667ab39fe87041c8818e74a50ebe3693.mp4?t=1786438697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Involved Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and interact with the objects in your apartment. But don't go inside <i><strong>that</strong></i> room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/18dfc3332dcf1b42e604513018c7ed00.poster.avif?t=1786438697\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/18dfc3332dcf1b42e604513018c7ed00.webm?t=1786438697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/18dfc3332dcf1b42e604513018c7ed00.mp4?t=1786438697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real when shared</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the last night for both of you, possibly the last sentient life in the universe. You should at least try to make it a happy one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/5f322daf8eb35a48b151bf0ce5e6033f.poster.avif?t=1786438697\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/5f322daf8eb35a48b151bf0ce5e6033f.webm?t=1786438697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4549500/extras/5f322daf8eb35a48b151bf0ce5e6033f.mp4?t=1786438697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Sleepover is a narrative-driven cosmic horror adventure about the last two humans alive. After Earth's population mysteriously vanishes, the sole survivor Yuna struggles to find meaning in an empty world. Afte